[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3713197300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114641#issuecomment-3713197300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114641","id":3713197300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dUuT0","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T05:44:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T05:44:47Z","body":"Note: we need to verify the behaviour on Quest, or confirm that Quest indeed does not apply dynamic resolution on OpenGL.\r\nI suspect the latter as this was introduced in 4.4: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407\r\n\r\nIf Quest does apply dynamic resolution on Quest, we need to find out whether SteamVR is at fault, or Meta is at fault.\r\n\r\nThe [OpenXR specification](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/xrspec.html#XR_KHR_opengl_enable) states:\r\n```\r\nThe OpenXR runtime must interpret the bottom-left corner of the swapchain image as the coordinate origin unless specified otherwise by extension functionality.\r\n```\r\n\r\nBased on that, this PR would result in the correct behaviour according to the spec (or at least my interpretation thereof :) ).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3713197300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3715056460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114641#issuecomment-3715056460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114641","id":3715056460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7db0NM","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T15:06:58Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T15:06:58Z","body":"Unfortunately, this breaks dynamic resolution on Meta Quest. When it changes resolution, the image will jitter up and down in an unsettling way, and display an incorrect result.\r\n\r\nI tested with [my fork of the GDQuest TPS demo](https://github.com/dsnopek/gdquest-tps-demo/tree/standalone-vr-benchmark), but with the openxr_vendors_repo updated to 4.2.2 and foveation disabled, as well as some other projects. You can get it to do more resolution changes if you increase the frame rate to 90 or 120.\r\n\r\nWe'll either need to figure out some way to do this that works for both (without special casing for the OpenXR runtime, because let's not do that) or convince either Meta or Valve that they are doing it wrong :-)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3715056460/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3717045118","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114641#issuecomment-3717045118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114641","id":3717045118,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7djZt-","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T02:08:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T02:08:27Z","body":"Ok, so looks like my project was too performant :P :P\r\n\r\nok good to know that there is a structural difference between Meta and Valve in implementing this extension. We'll have to see how this plays out.\r\n\r\nI'm going to change this to a draft until we get clarity.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3717045118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4036232442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114641#issuecomment-4036232442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114641","id":4036232442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wlAT6","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T04:19:52Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T04:19:52Z","body":"Valve has solved this on their end. We may need to revisit this at some point if the OpenXR spec enforces positioning, we'll see.\r\n\r\nFor now closing this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4036232442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]